  "question": {
    "text": "For a specific wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>670</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math> of light coming from a galaxy moving with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>, the observed wavelength is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>670</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> is"
  },
